{
  "repository": "https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness",
  "changes": [
    "Import aliases target the selected local closure.",
    "ScopedStandardSourceBinding.ctx is an opaque RSI object instead of a Cordis Context.",
    "Dockkit keeps upstream geometry and gestures; imports use its separately pinned minimal primitive closure. Icon source retains only the four required glyphs and their helpers. exports.ts is an RSI import adapter.",
